msgid ""
"When you use the CRS calculator on this website, we collect your answers "
"(age, education, language test scores, work experience and similar), your "
"name, email address, and optionally your phone number. We use them to "
"calculate your estimated CRS score and to contact you about your immigration "
"options. If you opt in, we may also send you updates. We store a one-way "
"coded version of your IP address to block spam; we do not store the IP "
"address itself. Your data is stored on this website only and is not sent to "
"Lawzeek or anyone else by the calculator. You can ask us to export or delete "
"your data at any time."
